  biomeName: Pothole Fields
  minDepthMeters: 600
  maxDepthMeters: 1000
  shortDescription: A meteor-like field of circular seabed depressions.
  isPlaceholder: 0
  visitPurpose: Early exploration biome. Come here to learn routes, gather basics,
    and work around bowls, pools, and local hotspots.
  commonRewardHook: Common runs pay out in Silica Shards and Copper Ore.
  rareRewardHook: 'Rare pull is modest: Electrolyte Salts and Sealant Pack.'
  landmarkIdentity: Pothole Fields reads through bowls, pools, domes, and hotspot
    basins. Landmarks should feel bright and readable.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets are frequent. The player should often see a clear
    reset point nearby.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: localized danger pockets and hostile basins. Creature
    pressure stays low_to_medium.'
  extractionFocus: 'Broad sweep collection, light salvage, and scattered node stops.
    Early tier: keep runs short and expect basin pockets, salvage traps, and local
    hotspots.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is basin lip or dune crest line. This slot
    should read through soft bowls and ripple seams; use bowls and hotspot rims to
    remember loops.
